  "description": "The Ryu Whiteboard app: an Excalidraw whiteboard shipped as a full-page Companion (Path B, ui_format:\"html\"). Persists as a Space document via the spaces:docs capability; built to one self-contained HTML via vite-plugin-singlefile.",
